r with Requiem, so maybe I didn\u2019t notice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T16:49:44-07:00","id":1396747,"title":"","content":"KotE was itself a massive retcon, whereas in 1e and 2e the Gaki and \u201cCathayans\u201d generally were presented as the same sort of creature as the rest of vampiredom, though they were assumed to have their own native clans and sects. The Camarilla presence in Japan goes back to 2e. It\u2019s not surprising that the sudden plopping of KotE stuff into the continuity didn\u2019t gel with stuff that had already been established.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T22:50:11-07:00","id":1413915,"title":"","content":"A trivia: In Heresy of Way, Radha the Usurper, a Face of Gods Wan Gui, is a potent foe of his child, Ratti-Ben, who also makes home in Vrindavan. So I think it is still possible he has conflict during Revised","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-1